# A right-click on the strip's `󰐕` (column 47 with ` alpha.zig 󰅖 `
# before it — the tree is 30 wide) drops the New menu; `New ▸` opens
# its submenu whose first row carries a `⋯` kebab; the kebab's menu
# pins the row.
write alpha.zig "const alpha = 1;\n"
open alpha.zig
rightclick 47 1
expect screen contains "New"
click 55 2
expect screen contains "New file…"
expect screen contains "⋯"
click 89 2
expect screen contains "Pin to top"
expect screen lacks "Rename…"
